{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a physics-based casual sandbox game, where there are no limits to your creativity. Mess around with liquids, explore the space, build machines, or just explode everything you can see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore various zones, like surface, the caves and the terrain. Using various object, that will help you in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be creative however you like to be. Express your ideas through your buildings. Your imagination is literally your only limit, as the tools like block pallet and console exist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883870?t=1765201480","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883870?t=1765201480","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883870/025a231b5f9e7b54f181e4caec56267b0ff32d46/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765201480","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883870/025a231b5f9e7b54f181e4caec56267b0ff32d46/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765201480","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a physics-based casual sandbox game, where there are no limits to your creativity. Mess around with liquids, explore the space, build machin